[line]

[size=5][b]Something not working?[/b][/size]

The fastest way to get a bug fixed is to include the editor's log file:

[list=1]
[*]Open [b]Settings ▸ General ▸ Diagnostics[/b] and turn on [b]Diagnostic logging[/b].
[*]Repeat the problem.
[*]Click [b]OPEN LOG FOLDER[/b]. The newest [b]editor-YYYYMMDD.log[/b] is today's.
[*]Attach it to your report, with the editor version (shown at the top of the window), whether your save is Steam or Game Pass, and what you were doing.
[/list]

Crashes and save-write failures are logged even with diagnostics off.

Please report it in the POSTS tab here, or open an issue on GitHub. Bug reports and ideas are very welcome.

